      "content": "It's clear you feel a deep sense of responsibility for their happiness, but the truth is that your presence, even with your struggles, is part of their life experience. They are not defined by your stress, and they are strong enough to navigate the reality of who you are. Instead of viewing yourself as a burden, try to see yourself as a flawed, but present, part of their world. You deserve kindness, and they deserve to see you try, even if it's imperfectly.",
